a The relay tries to carry the branch bay1-identity to GitHub on every ten-minute beat and is refused every time, because the branch changes .github/workflows/smoke.yml and our token has no workflow scope on purpose; nothing ever stops it trying
b GitHub's merge button does not apply merge=union, so two branches that each add or revise a line of .issues collide there; a Land order on the origin (Helm's /origin/) merges by main's own attributes and keeps both lines, so the button is no longer needed for this
a Not decided: whether a finished issue's line leaves .issues, or stays and is marked
a docs/OPEN.md keeps 152 open items by hand, a line each, beside .issues; not decided whether they move here
a main pins .you-engine (FCCN-ANTIBODY/you.anecdote.channel, with FCCN-ANTIBODY/anecdote.channel inside it) and the origin holds neither, so a machine that needs the bottle code has nowhere to get it from now that only the origin may be asked
